      "content": "The Board is extremely risk-averse right now, especially after the setbacks with the last oncology line. If I walk in there talking about \"moderate noise\" and \"variability,\" they're going to see it as a red flag and might freeze the funding for the entire XJ-9 program before we even get to Phase III. \n\nCan you give me a more precise confidence percentage for these projections? I need to know if this is a solid bet we can stand behind, or if we're looking at a high-risk gamble.",
